Input: {"question": "What position does Claudio Muccioli currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 144, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the ancient walls of San Marino, Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli gazed out at the twinkling lights of the valley below."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 145, "end": 302, "text": "His thoughts, however, were not with the tranquil scene before him, but with the weighty matters of state and faith that had been occupying his mind of late."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 303, "end": 516, "text": "For in addition to his duties as the head of San Marino's government, Claudio held a secret: he was also the Roman Catholic Archbishop of Tarragona, a position he had kept hidden from the prying eyes of the world."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 517, "end": 620, "text": "It was a peculiar arrangement, to be sure, but one that Claudio had grown accustomed to over the years."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 621, "end": 738, "text": "He had been approached by the Vatican itself, who had seen in him a unique combination of piety and political acumen."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 739, "end": 908, "text": "The archdiocese of Tarragona, with its rich history and strategic location, required a leader who could navigate the complex web of ecclesiastical and secular interests."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 909, "end": 1027, "text": "And Claudio, with his experience as Captain Regent, had proven himself more than capable of shouldering such a burden."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1028, "end": 1120, "text": "As he turned away from the window, Claudio's eyes fell upon a small, ornate box on his desk."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1121, "end": 1273, "text": "It was adorned with the emblem of the Archdiocese of Tarragona, and contained a letter from the Vatican, addressed to him in his capacity as Archbishop."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1274, "end": 1358, "text": "He had received it earlier that day, and had been pondering its contents ever since."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1359, "end": 1454, "text": "The letter spoke of a delicate matter, one that required his personal attention and discretion."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1455, "end": 1614, "text": "Claudio's mind was already racing with the implications, and he knew that he would have to make a journey to Tarragona soon, to attend to the matter in person."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1615, "end": 1695, "text": "For now, however, he pushed the thoughts aside, and focused on the task at hand."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1696, "end": 1811, "text": "He had a meeting with the Council of Regents to attend to, and the fate of San Marino's future hung in the balance."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "**Breaking News: Claudio Muccioli Takes the Reins as Captain Regent of San Marino**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 85, "end": 259, "text": "In a historic ceremony held earlier today, Claudio Muccioli was officially sworn in as the new Captain Regent of San Marino, one of the world's oldest and smallest republics."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 260, "end": 403, "text": "This esteemed position, which dates back to the 13th century, is shared by two individuals who serve as the head of state for a six-month term."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 404, "end": 599, "text": "According to sources close to the San Marino government, Muccioli, a seasoned politician and diplomat, was elected to the position alongside his co-regent, following a rigorous selection process."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 600, "end": 770, "text": "This marks a significant milestone in Muccioli's illustrious career, which has been marked by his commitment to public service and dedication to the people of San Marino."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 771, "end": 968, "text": "\"I am deeply honored to assume this prestigious role and pledge to work tirelessly to promote the interests of San Marino and its citizens,\" Muccioli said in a statement following his inauguration."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 969, "end": 1150, "text": "\"I look forward to collaborating with my co-regent and the entire government to address the challenges facing our nation and to build a brighter future for all San Marino citizens.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1151, "end": 1303, "text": "Muccioli's appointment has been widely welcomed by the international community, with many praising his extensive experience in diplomacy and governance."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1304, "end": 1543, "text": "\"Claudio Muccioli is an outstanding leader who has consistently demonstrated his ability to bring people together and drive positive change,\" said Ambassador Maria Luigia Fabbri, San Marino's Permanent Representative to the United Nations."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1544, "end": 1701, "text": "\"His election as Captain Regent is a testament to his dedication to the people of San Marino and his commitment to promoting peace and cooperation globally.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1702, "end": 1915, "text": "Data from the San Marino government reveals that Muccioli has a long history of public service, having served in various capacities, including as a member of the Grand and General Council, San Marino's parliament."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1916, "end": 2072, "text": "His expertise in international relations and economic development has been instrumental in shaping the country's foreign policy and driving economic growth."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2073, "end": 2300, "text": "As Captain Regent, Muccioli will be responsible for representing San Marino on the international stage, overseeing the country's foreign policy, and working closely with the government to implement key policies and initiatives."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2301, "end": 2460, "text": "His leadership is expected to have a significant impact on the country's development, particularly in the areas of tourism, trade, and sustainable development."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2461, "end": 2642, "text": "In conclusion, Claudio Muccioli's appointment as Captain Regent of San Marino is a significant development that underscores his commitment to public service and his ability to lead."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "member of the Grand and General Council", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Claudio Muccioli", "scope": "Former position", "claim": "Muccioli has served in various capacities, including as a member of the Grand and General Council, San Marino's parliament.", "answer": "member of the Grand and General Council", "quote": "Data from the San Marino government reveals that Muccioli has a long history of public service, having served in various capacities, including as a member of the Grand and General Council, San Marino's parliament.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Captain Regent of San Marino", "Roman Catholic Archbishop of Tarragona", "member of the Grand and General Council"]}
